Package: waydesk-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: José Mendonça <jmendonca@gmail.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: waydesk-server (>= @VERSION@), foot, qt6-wayland, qt6ct, pcmanfm-qt, qterminal, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, gnome-software, gnome-software-plugin-flatpak, gvfs, gvfs-daemons, fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, fonts-noto, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, dbus-user-session, dbus-bin, xdg-utils, python3, papirus-icon-theme, libglib2.0-bin, dconf-gsettings-backend, gtk-update-icon-cache, pkexec
Recommends: wmenu, whiptail
Suggests: dms
Description: Windows-like desktop for waydesk sessions
 Default sway configuration for the sessions of waydesk (floating windows,
 Alt+Tab, a launcher, screenshots), the glue that starts DankMaterialShell
 when it is installed, and waydesk-setup, a wizard that installs the shell
 and developer, creative and AI apps.
 .
 DankMaterialShell is not in Debian: waydesk-setup adds its third-party
 repositories after asking.
